Z||000009||StuGood||08-20-2001||02:02 AM||||I let my brother drive my practically brand new 1986 Fiero (obviously quite a few years ago).  He started to drive away, then (yes) <B>stopped</B>, came back into the house and asked me if the e-brake was non-functional.  Nope, I said, and I told him how to properly release the parking brake.  Thank goodness he had the brains to realize something was wrong (that is, the parking brake was on), instead of driving all 15 miles to my other brother's house, with the brake on!<P>Brothers like this are cool.  Not too proud to admit when he doesn't know something, even if he is the best mechanic in Lafayette, IN  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>  ||||reg||6
